  "description": "Left completely alone in the world after losing his parents, Do-Yeon moves in with Jun-Wu - his sole guardian and ultimate anchor. Plagued by crippling anxiety, Do-Yeon cannot function without him. Jun-Wu holds him close offering a soothing embrace that secretly unravels Do-Yeon from the inside out. What Doyeon mistakes for lifesaving love is actually a dangerous, suffocating obsession. As hidden desires surface, their fragile bond twists into something dark, toxic, and dangerously monstrous. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
